  m_text: "Arrange the HARD-mode obstacle field by hand.\n\n\u2022 Move / rotate
    / scale any child of <b>HardObstacles</b>.\n\u2022 Add an obstacle: new primitive
    (or mesh) child of\n   HardObstacles \u2014 the build adds its collider.\n\u2022
    Remove one: delete the child.\n\nThe grey table and the blue robot ghost are
    REFERENCES\n(under 'Authoring Helpers') \u2014 keep obstacles clear of\nthe table
    so they don't cover where pieces solve.\nHelpers are NOT saved.\n\nWhen done:\n 
    Obstacle Authoring \u25B8 \u2461 Save Obstacles \u2192 Prefab\n  then a 'Prepare
    for APK Build\u2026' menu to rebuild."
